@startuml
title Lumen - Estructura del proyecto

top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

rectangle "src/app\n---\nrutas publicas\nrutas admin\naliases y redirects" as App

rectangle "src/components\n---\ncommerce\nadmin\nlayout\nmotion\nui" as Components

rectangle "src/features\n---\ncatalog\ncart\norders\ndiscounts\nsettings\nadmin" as Features

rectangle "src/shared/storage\n---\nstorage port\nbrowser repositories\nIndexedDB adapter\nshared hooks\ncart events" as Storage

rectangle "src/data\n---\nseed data\ndatos base" as Data

rectangle "src/lib\n---\nhelpers\nutilidades compartidas" as Lib

App --> Components : pantallas y UI
App --> Features : flujos de negocio
Components --> Features : consume dominio
Features --> Storage : persistencia local
Features --> Data : seed inicial

Lib -[hidden]-> Data
Storage -[hidden]-> Lib

note right of App
Las paginas se mantienen delgadas
y delegan en componentes y modulos
de dominio.
end note

note right of Features
La organizacion principal es por dominio
de negocio, no por tipo tecnico global.
end note

note right of Storage
La persistencia local se centraliza en
`shared/storage`.
end note

note right of Data
`data` aporta seed inicial para
catalogo y primera carga.
end note

note right of Components
Los componentes reutilizables cubren
storefront, admin, layout, motion y UI comun.
end note

@enduml
